#
# Task Spec
# What:
# - Update `.gitignore` to include required clean-worktree gate artifacts:
#   `CODE_GRAPH.json`, `CODE_GRAPH.md`, `PROJECT_GRAPH.json`, `PROJECT_GRAPH.md`.
# - Keep ignore-list changes minimal and scoped to the failing quality gate.
# - Add `clean_worktree` npm script wiring in `package.json` only if needed for command verification.
# Verify:
# - `node -e "const {evaluateCleanWorktree}=require('/Users/clawdbot/.openclaw/genome/core/clean-worktree-gate'); const r=evaluateCleanWorktree(process.cwd()); console.log(r); process.exit(r.passed?0:1)"` exits 0.
# - `npm run clean_worktree` exits 0.
# - `rg -n "^(CODE_GRAPH\\.json|CODE_GRAPH\\.md|PROJECT_GRAPH\\.json|PROJECT_GRAPH\\.md)$" .gitignore` returns all four entries.
# Boundaries:
# - Do not modify application logic, services, routes, migrations, or tests for this fix.
# - Do not alter unrelated `.gitignore` patterns beyond required clean-worktree entries.
# - Do not change dependency versions or runtime behavior.
#

